          "settings": {
            "question": "Shelf Life",
            "answer": "<p>Q. How should I store the Homemade Mango Pickle?<br/><br/>A. Store it in a cool and dry place and refrigerate after opening. Always use a dry spoon when serving to maintain freshness and prevent contamination.<br/><br/>Q. What is the shelf life?<br/><br/>A. Best before 12 months from the date of packaging when stored properly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_CKHxM7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Storage Instructions",
            "answer": "<p>Q: How should I store this product?<br/>A: Store in a cool and dry place away from direct sunlight. Do not refrigerate.<br/><br/>Q: What precautions should I take when using this product?<br/>A: Always use a dry spoon when scooping. Avoid using wet utensils as moisture can affect the product quality.<br/><br/>Q: How do I maintain freshness?<br/>A: Stir occasionally to maintain consistency and ensure even distribution of ingredients.</p>"
          }
        }
